{
    "article_summary": "The article describes a dual nickel-photoredox-catalyzed synthesis of amides via the redox-neutral decarboxylative cross-coupling of cesium oxamates with aryl bromides. The method utilizes 4CzIPN as an organic dye photocatalyst and NiBr2\u00b7dtbbpy as the metal catalyst under visible light irradiation. DFT studies indicate the reaction proceeds through a radical addition pathway to the Ni(0) species followed by oxidative insertion of the aryl bromide.",
